      "text": "## 🧭 解題總則",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "l1_1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "file",
      "file": "tools/工具-程式面試解題套路.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "l1_2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "> 「不要一拿到題目就開始寫程式，先想清楚再動手。」"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🔍 三招釐清思路",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 515,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "l2_1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**畫圖**\n讓抽象問題形象化"
    },
    {
      "id": "l2_2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 490,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**舉例**\n用具體例子讓抽象問題具體化"
    },
    {
      "id": "l2_3",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**分解**\n讓複雜問題簡單化"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ✅ 程式碼品質",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 1005,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "l3_1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 830,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**邊界條件**\n首尾、長度 0／1、越界"
    },
    {
      "id": "l3_2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**特殊輸入**\n空值、極值、非法輸入"
    },
    {
      "id": "l3_3",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1130,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**錯誤處理**\n明確定義失敗時的行為"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ⚡ 複雜度與優化",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "l4_1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**主動分析複雜度**\n講出時間／空間成本，不等面試官問"
    },
    {
      "id": "l4_2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1470,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**嘗試更優解**\n從能動的解往更低複雜度推進"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 💬 面試溝通",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 1760,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "l5_1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1660,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**溝通勝於沉默**\n邊想邊講，讓面試官看到你的思路"
    },
    {
      "id": "l5_2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1810,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**講出取捨**\n說明為何選這個做法、放棄了什麼"
    }
  ],
